    "citation": {
      "form": "Publication 527",
      "line": "De minimis safe harbor for tangible property",
      "revision": "2025",
      "wording": "may deduct these amounts as rental expenses on line 19 of Schedule E",
      "source_url": "https://www.irs.gov/pub/irs-prior/p527--2025.pdf"
    },
    "open_point": "The limit is per item OR invoice; the sheet sees the client's line items, so it tests each line. The election covers every qualifying cost of the year and is a statement the preparer attaches to the return. Schedule C puts these on line 48 (Other expenses), which reaches line 27b; land and inventory are never eligible."
